{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17439","headline":"卦名诗 · 权德舆","name":"卦名诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"节变忽惊春，临风骋望频。\n支颐倦书幌，步履整山巾。\n时鸟渐成曲，杂芳随意新。\n曙霞连观阙，绮陌丽咸秦。\n天地今交泰，云雷背遘屯。\n中孚谅可乐，书此示家人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17439.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17439","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}